        "notes": "The federation's own first weekly report: a 42-wrestler active roster (all 42 wrestling this week), a full opening-week match log of 54 bouts across singles and tag action, and its first title lineage across the World, Intercontinental, Tag Team and Television Championships, all four already held by the time the report went out and each defended once this same week. Staged as an in-fiction broadcast with three commentators (Joe Blimpko, Robby the Lame, Raunchy Ronny Trumpet) trading commentary between results, plus in-character promo segments for the Vikings (Thor and Odin) and Kataklysma, and a fictional cross-promotional bit for a Sumo cartoon/merchandise line."
    }
